revision.text:
{{Disambiguation}}
An ''outsider'' is a context-specific term, generally used to refer to someone who is not from the plane the speaker is currently in.
* [[Outsider (Prime)|Outsider]], a term planars use for people from the [[Prime Material plane]], also known disparagingly as "Clueless." * [[Outsider (Planar)|Outsider]], a creature type first described in 3rd Edition, noting that a creature is composed at least partly of the essence of a plane outside of the Prime Material.
